LUMA SUMMARY:
QSV 2.6 narrows the voice failure to the Read Aloud UI location rather than the voice toggle itself. The current ChatGPT UI has moved Read Aloud under the More Actions menu, so QSV 2.7 is designed from the 2.6 baseline to probe both the direct control and the overflow-menu path while leaving relay logic untouched.</summary>
